<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/><meta name="description" content="Find answers to common questions about studying abroad with Go2Abroad."/><title>FAQs | Go2Abroad</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/globals.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/animations.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/page.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/content-pages.css"/></head><body class="faq-page"><div class="site-shell"><?php $basePath = ''; include_once __DIR__ . '/header.php'; ?><main><section class="faq-hero"><p class="eyebrow light">QUESTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p><h1>Let’s clear<br/><em>a few things up.</em></h1><p>Start with the answers below. If your question is more personal, our counsellors are one conversation away.</p><a class="button button-accent" href="contact-us.php">Ask your question ↗</a></section><section class="faq-content content-container"><div class="faq-side"><p class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Clarity feels<br/><em>like progress.</em></h2><p>Rules, costs and timelines can change. We’ll help you understand what applies to your profile and what needs to be checked.</p></div><div class="faq-list-page"><div class="faq-item open"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>When should I start planning to study abroad?</span><b>−</b></button><p>Ideally, begin 8–12 months before your preferred intake. We can help map your profile, shortlist, documents and timeline.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>How do I choose the right country and university?</span><b>+</b></button><p hidden>We look at your goals, academic profile, budget, preferred lifestyle, course fit and career direction to build a responsible shortlist.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can you help with scholarships and funding?</span><b>+</b></button><p hidden>We can guide you in identifying relevant scholarship, loan and funding options. Eligibility and availability must always be confirmed with the official provider.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What support is available after I receive an offer?</span><b>+</b></button><p hidden>Support can continue through financial file preparation, visa readiness, pre-departure planning, accommodation, travel and arrival checklists.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can you guarantee my visa, admission or job?</span><b>+</b></button><p hidden>No. We provide responsible guidance and preparation, but universities, visa authorities and employers make their own decisions.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What should I share in my first counselling call?</span><b>+</b></button><p hidden>Share your qualification, grades, preferred intake, course interests, destination ideas, budget and any questions or concerns.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-cta"><div><p class="eyebrow light">STILL HAVE A QUESTION?</p><h2>Let’s talk about<br/><em>your situation.</em></h2></div><a class="button button-accent" href="contact-us.php">Contact us ↗</a></section></main><?php $basePath = ''; include_once __DIR__ . '/footer.php'; ?></div><script>const b=document.getElementById('menuButton'),n=document.getElementById('mobileNav');b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const o=n.classList.toggle('is-open');b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',o);b.textContent=o?'×':'☰'});document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item button').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const item=button.parentElement,answer=item.querySelector('p'),open=item.classList.toggle('open');button.setAttribute('aria-expanded',open);button.querySelector('b').textContent=open?'−':'+';answer.hidden=!open;}));</script><script src="assets/js/site-chrome.js"></script>
</body></html>


